# Runtime artifacts — the trace is data, not source (docs/TRACE-SCHEMA.md).
# Anchored to the repository root: bench/ ships committed configuration with
# these very names, and an unanchored pattern would silently swallow it.
*.jsonl
/nodes.json
/router.json
/agent.json
*.log
bench/results/

